{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Uses a mid-synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a full astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times may differ by hours and the UTC date displayed may differ from a local calendar date. This global phase estimate does not calculate local moonrise and moonset, visibility, or religious calendar dates.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"moon-phase-calculator UI copy.fields.methodNote","detected_language":"es","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote","keys":["moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote"],"locale":"es","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Utiliza un ciclo sinódico medio anclado a una luna nueva de referencia, no una efeméride astronómica completa.Las horas de fase individuales pueden diferir por horas y la fecha UTC mostrada puede diferir de una fecha de calendario local.Esta estimación de fase global no calcula la salida y puesta de la luna local, la visibilidad o las fechas del calendario religioso.","record_id":"0fb45fbcbabeac4abebdeae9f0556b0345e4dd4e86be817169055811be6d9781","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.185632302000002,"source":"Uses a mean synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a full astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times can differ by hours and the displayed UTC date can differ from a local calendar date. This global phase estimate does not calculate local moonrise, moonset, visibility, or religious calendar dates.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"30870c684a9b7cbcd78603b289a08388959d9db0a9b4d591addd5741a14786a4","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Utiliza un ciclo sinódico medio anclado a una luna nueva de referencia, no una efeméride astronómica completa.Las horas de fase individuales pueden diferir por horas y la fecha UTC mostrada puede diferir de una fecha de calendario local.Esta estimación de fase global no calcula la salida y puesta de la luna local, la visibilidad o las fechas del calendario religioso.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
